                                "sense_id": "72b90573-afa3-376a-b3f1-48368cf41a21",
                                "text": "He had, back in Cambridge, taken one of Jem Follett’s boys for a penny, an envisioned Tom Walsingham in his head like a god and the motion towards irrumation like a prayer."
                            },
