                                "example_id": "ed196348-9ef5-41f8-9bb3-e74409cd260f",
                                "sense_id": "72b90573-afa3-376a-b3f1-48368cf41a21",
                                "text": "Anal intercourse is reported in between 6-26% of female complainants, but it is important to remember that there may have been a number of different sexual acts performed by the assailant, including irrumation (forced oral penetration) or cunnilingus."
